eEBmofgHiafRDYGHk0xhkNeUzjrlzzQe322RG4PMHuXw8LPZE3N3TvXriaBDmcs0pvHpgAT9zt6hqbQq154c%2F0","http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FSMGWzs6WvCWKXib4G1cGFCEicxOVRnuhLugcCCjGBBicpcaXTTnsgsWzDFX5RonylNhDOTZV0mtujM4DFlQWklbrkq33giaTrt2etyPgZt1xPY0%2F0"],"type":"gallery","published":"2026-11-22T16:28:03.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzAxMjIyNDE4Mg%3D%3D:2651759355:1","title":"树犹如此，人何以堪","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAxMjIyNDE4Mg==&mid=2651759355&idx=1&sn=f8743a8a4287a2f70db02bdb84d7c8ef&chksm=817cb4970e2a61902f3892b905e3fc5911900901c0bd048bf663f3d079828a2a35a62ebaf1a0&scene=126&sessionid=1795679774#rd","description":"窗外下着大雨，即使躲在屋檐下也不免感到丝丝寒意，才突然想起来，这是快要入秋了？\n本想冒出一句：欲语还休，却道天凉好个秋。算了，心静如水，我有啥要语不语的，早过了内耗的年纪了。\n不过，确实时间也快，白马过隙，半点不留，想起东晋大将军恒温的典故，他在行军途中，途经旧地，看到年轻时种下的柳树已长得很高大了，想到自己也老了，而功业未就，不禁泪流满面，抚着树干，发出了那句千古一叹：“树犹如此，人何以堪。”","content":"<p>窗外下着大雨，即使躲在屋檐下也不免感到丝丝寒意，才突然想起来，这是快要入秋了？<br />本想冒出一句：欲语还休，却道天凉好个秋。算了，心静如水，我有啥要语不语的，早过了内耗的年纪了。<br />不过，确实时间也快，白马过隙，半点不留，想起东晋大将军恒温的典故，他在行军途中，途经旧地，看到年轻时种下的柳树已长得很高大了，想到自己也老了，而功业未就，不禁泪流满面，抚着树干，发出了那句千古一叹：“树犹如此，人何以堪。”</p>\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FSMGWzs6WvCX4npNxoCw40g6lsE9jCBWIDuicAUtyibLqF2KkdvayQaRENmbYiczMPMXwz0eTyjLh9JdboclOhibSwgYLOIhDMdpHbMgncVXcJ7k%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FSMGWzs6WvCXR2EyRxCIcMAhAHSkicxZI10oZJxv34ygJIyVpNxMN69J0D1Y7b4nicAhKgLX03ZKEbNEibhUlaxt8njsibHKS1mLpoyp7WjndkIE%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","images":["http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FSMGWzs6WvCX4npNxoCw40g6lsE9jCBWIDuicAUtyibLqF2KkdvayQaRENmbYiczMPMXwz0eTyjLh9JdboclOhibSwgYLOIhDMdpHbMgncVXcJ7k%2F0"],"type":"gallery","published":"2026-11-22T16:28:03.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzAxMjIyNDE4Mg%3D%3D:2651759299:1","title":"OpenAI 发布会里一页价值万亿的PPT","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAxMjIyNDE4Mg==&mid=2